@Bettina, the official handoff of Pellucid Harbor Logistics to Kwame was **November 3, 2025**. Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday 11/2 says ownership "changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03."

For the tracker, note that Kwame didn't take over day-to-day work until **November 22, 2025**. Your cutover recap from 2025-12-08 says you kept running the account through November 21 and that he fully took over on the 22nd. If the tracker needs the operational date, use the 22nd, and record the 3rd as the official change.

